    "bbox": [
      58.58,
      510.49,
      552.55,
      548.95
    ],
    "text": "Heavy falls above 100 mm are likely at some places in Western, Sabaragamuwa, Central and North-central provinces and in Trincomalee and Kurunegala districts.",
